        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Textile fragment of brocaded silk, woven in coloured silk and gilt paper strips on a black satin ground. Decoration consists of broad diagonally intersecting bands, displaying a variety of geometrical diaper-patterns, that form square compartments which enclose horizontal rows of ducks and elephants amid a background of conventional cloud ornament."@en , "Textile fragment of brocaded silk, woven in coloured silk and gilt paper strips on a satin ground, Japan, 19th century"@en ;
